### Proof architecture (the MGF core)
Regime split on `t²K² ≤ 1` vs `> 1`:
- **Small t:** Vershynin's `e^u ≤ u + e^{u²}` (proved as `exp_le_add_exp_sq`, 3-case: `u≥1` monotonicity, `u≤0` via the ForMathlib nonpos Taylor brick, `0<u<1` via `Real.exp_bound'` at n=3) + mean-zero cancellation of the linear term + weighted-power interpolation `e^{(tX)²} ≤ t²K²·e^{(X/K)²} + (1−t²K²)` (from `Real.geom_mean_le_arith_mean2_weighted`) ⇒ `∫ ≤ 1 + t²K² ≤ e^{t²K²} ≤ e^{3K²t²/2}`.
- **Large t:** AM–GM `e^{tX} ≤ e^{t²K²/2}·e^{(X/K)²/2}` + `∫ e^{(X/K)²/2} ≤ 3/2` (via `e^{v/2} ≤ (e^v+1)/2`) ⇒ `(3/2)·e^{t²K²/2} ≤ e^{3K²t²/2}` since `3/2 ≤ e ≤ e^{t²K²}`.

